§§ `The cover letter bound into the file (PDF page 59)`

-- Page 59 is a report from Tasco to the Insurance Supervisory Authority of the Ministry of
-- Finance announcing the product. It is not part of the rules and binds no policyholder; it is
-- carried because it is in the document, and because it is the only typed statement of the dates
-- that pages 1 and 3 give in handwriting. Its own number and date are left blank on the page.
